/-!
# Literal inputs for the degree-1792 order-23 certificate

These are binary rows for the addition chain 1, 2, 3, 5, 10, 20, 23.
Only the comparisons `firstRows_eq` and `secondRows_eq` identify these
literals with the original ATLAS input. The power names are candidate labels;
the multiplication certificates must establish every intermediate product.
Each raw numeral still denotes an ordinary natural number checked by Lean.

Source: ATLAS M24G1-f2r1792B0.m1/.m2 and word 2 of M24G1-P1.
See `source/README.md` and the original `../../../source/README.md`.
-/

